# {{ project_name }}

HTTP API service generated with Gondola CLI.

## Prerequisites

- Python 3.12+
- Poetry
- PostgreSQL (async access via asyncpg; Alembic uses a sync connection)

## Setup

```bash
poetry install
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your DATABASE_URL and other settings
gondola migrate upgrade
gondola run server
```

Open `http://localhost:8000/docs` for interactive API documentation.

Optional: send `API-Version: v1` on requests; if omitted, the app defaults to **v1**.

## Layout

```
.
├── api/                 # HTTP layer (routers, models, schemas, services)
│   ├── models/
│   │   └── schemas/     # Pydantic schemas per resource
│   └── routers/
├── core/                # Settings, database, logging
├── db/migrations/       # Alembic
└── test/                # Pytest
```

## Tests

```bash
pytest
```

